      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Open decisions / ops\n\n- Wave F: canary or global launch for LVA group reports.\n- Wave G: QSP v2 re-seed run + publish remains manual.\n- Jeff-gated: LVA #29 content reconcile; remove empty Welcome/Completion pager pages.\n- Wave H: admin nav group dropdowns + platform.scalingup.com.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
