      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Suggested next sequence\n\n1. Start PR-1 security remediation: broken function-level authz + file read policy + rate limits.\n2. Then PR-2 / PR-2b query and pagination cleanup.\n3. Then PR-3 email retry idempotency and PR-4 robustness.\n4. In parallel, scope Wave H product work.",
